<p>The NSW Design System can be used by any department and brand classification, to provide a consistent approach to UI and UX for designers and developers. Even if you're not using the component kits, <a href="/get-started/our-ecosystem.html">our ecosystem</a> allows teams to identify and use only what they require.</p>

<p>While the out-of-the-box branding reflects masterbrand corporate, the in-built theming framework can be adapted for all <a class="nsw-link nsw-link--icon" href="https://www.nsw.gov.au/branding/nsw-government-brand-framework#toc-brand-categories" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="masterbrand (opens in a new tab)"><span>masterbrand</span><span class="material-icons nsw-material-icons" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">open_in_new</span></a>, <a class="nsw-link nsw-link--icon" href="https://www.nsw.gov.au/branding/nsw-government-brand-framework#toc-brand-categories" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="co-brand (opens in a new tab)"><span>co-brand</span><span class="material-icons nsw-material-icons" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">open_in_new</span></a> and even <a class="nsw-link nsw-link--icon" href="https://www.nsw.gov.au/branding/nsw-government-brand-framework#toc-brand-categories" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="independent (opens in a new tab)"><span>independent</span><span class="material-icons nsw-material-icons" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">open_in_new</span></a> classification levels. <a class="nsw-link nsw-link--icon" href="https://www.nsw.gov.au/branding/nsw-government-brand-framework#toc-brand-categories" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Endorsed (opens in a new tab)"><span>Endorsed</span><span class="material-icons nsw-material-icons" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">open_in_new</span></a> and <a class="nsw-link nsw-link--icon" href="https://www.nsw.gov.au/branding/nsw-government-brand-framework#toc-brand-categories" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="stand-alone (opens in a new tab)"><span>stand-alone</span><span class="material-icons nsw-material-icons" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">open_in_new</span></a> brand classifications can also take advantage of the pre-built base, easily adapted to their own brand identity.</p>

<h2 id="product">Product managers</h2>
<p>Ensure your products are being built to brand, accessibility and development standards.</p>
<p>The NSW Design System:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Speeds up your design process</li>
    <li>Takes the burden of accessibility compliance off you (WCAG 2.2 AA)</li>
    <li>Ensures you're following NSW Government branding</li>
    <li>Enables your designers and developers to work off a common base</li>
</ul>
<p>Our pre-built kits:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Make your digital products responsive for mobile, tablet, and desktop</li>
    <li>Dramatically speed up your development process</li>
    <li>Allow you to share components with other design system users</li>
</ul>


<h2 id="designers">Designers</h2>
<p>Ideate and prototype faster with pre-built, accessible and tested assets. The NSW Design System provides a shared source for digital brand assets, detailed component and pattern guidance, responsive variants and reusable page templates.</p>
<p><a href="/get-started/for-designers.html">Get started as a designer</a>, or go directly to the <a href="/get-started/figma-ui-kit.html">Figma UI Kit</a>.</p>

<h2 id="developers">Developers</h2>
<p>Build more in less time with flexible and scalable pre-built solutions. The code package provides reusable components, core styles and helper classes designed for accessible, responsive and cross-browser implementation.</p>
<p><a href="/get-started/for-developers.html">Get started as a developer</a> for package installation, imports, JavaScript setup, CDN and starter options, browser support and updates.</p>


